The '''Spring-Time Cosmetic Pack''' is an active [[Gamepass]] featuring 5 exclusive skins regarding the '''[[Easter Toons]]''' and {{CI|Flutter|name=true}} in [[Dandy's World]]. It was introduced in [[Changelog|v0.17.1]] as the fifth gamepass available in [[Dandy's Store]].

==Description==
This gamepass features 5 exclusive skins for: Bassie, Cocoa, Eggson, Flutter, and Flyte! These skins feature unique particles, trails and ability effects. All features are cosmetic and do not effect gameplay.

==Effect==
Players who purchased this gamepass are rewarded 600 [[Ichor]] and receive the 5 matching skins for {{CI|Bassie|name=true}}, {{CI|Cocoa|name=true}}, {{CI|Eggson|name=true}}, {{CI|Flutter|name=true}}, and {{CI|Flyte|name=true}}.

